      "message": "2 kinds of compiler errors occur:\n\n* Error 1:\n453 |                 return Some(\u0026s.reg_id());                                                                                                                                                                                        \n    |                        ^^^^^^----------^                                                                                                                                                                                         \n    |                        |     |                                                                                                                                                                                                   \n    |                        |     temporary value created here                                                                                                                                                                        \n    |                        returns a value referencing data owned by the current function \n\n* Error 2:\n470     pub(crate) fn get_mut_by_advertiser_id(\n471         \u0026mut self,\n472         adv_id: \u0026AdvertiserId,\n473     ) -\u003e Option\u003c\u0026mut AdvertisingSetInfo\u003e {                                                                                                                                                                                                               \n474 |         if let Some(reg_id) \u003d self.find_reg_id(adv_id) {                                                                                                                                                                        \n    |                               ------------------------- immutable borrow occurs here                                                                                                                                             \n475 |             return self.get_mut_by_reg_id(reg_id);                                                           \n    |                    ^^^^^-----------------^^^^^^^^                                                            \n    |                    |    |                                                                                    \n    |                    |    immutable borrow later used by call\n    |                    mutable borrow occurs here \n\n\nI think both of them are resolvable, with the cost of extra memory copy. I actually have no concern with the little performance gap but would prefer to keep current implementation in this CL as the refactor needs more changes than I expected. We refactor this in another CL.",
